From 7fd3c049e84369a9d805614e01bc33dd75753e3d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 03:21:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] worker-placement: repin notice also fires for the
 overflow-off capability_mismatch/mixed rollup over the whole pool (#822)

The Board emits no_eligible_worker only on its overflow path; with worker_overflow off a card no pool worker is attested for queues as capability_mismatch, so #810's notice never fired live (fixture t_01a1a46cbd08b275).
---
