 hermes_cli/kanban_repin_notice.py            | 51 +++++++++++++++--
 hermes_cli/kanban_worker_placement.py        |  2 +-
 tests/hermes_cli/test_kanban_repin_notice.py | 60 ++++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 112 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)

